config MTK_HSAPIF_DRIVER
	bool "Enable Evolved CLDMA Driver as interface for PCIE"
	default y
	help
	  This option enables CLDMA device driver support,
	  if yes, then PC is using cldma driver,
	  if no, cldma driver is disabled.
	  The option default enable.

config MTK_HSAPIF_DUMP
	bool "CLDMA DUMP support"
	default y
	help
	  This option enables CLDMA device driver dump buffer support,
	  if yes, then cldma driver dump beffer is enabled,
	  if no, cldma driver dump beffer is disabled.
	  The option default enable.

config MTK_HSAPIF_PRI_PORT
	bool "CLDMA Private Port support"
	default y
	help
	  This option enables CLDMA device driver private port support,
	  if yes, then cldma driver private port is enabled,
	  if no, cldma driver private port is disabled.
	  The option default enable.